{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object detected, approach and grab it; otherwise move to next location. Check properties, do task, place object at destination.     list of available nodes: <Condition ID = IsObjectDetected    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToNextLocation    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = DoSpecificTask    /> <Action ID = PlaceObjectAtDestination    />",
